    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/810f0b57dcceeebd1d4b1d6554b26a50.avif?t=1755132100\" width=674 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the year 2073 in a post apocalyptic Lagos Nigeria, West Africa. Humanity is on the verge of extinction. The earth has fallen into ruin under the threat of an invasive alien species known as the Altrius.  Play as  Chimere Uzoma, a fierce and genetically enhanced human soldier called an &quot;Enforcer&quot;, who must protect one of the last enclaves of humanity called &quot;Azure&quot;. The Enforcers are created for one purpose: to turn the tide in the war against the Altrius. Dive into a narrative-rich campaign where the survival of humanity hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/900a1a893396da7afb7028802fb1123d.avif?t=1755132100\" width=780 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Introducing Synchronous Combat Mechanics System, Master an expansive combo system with interlinking moves across a variety of weapons. From melee swords and spears to projectile-based secondary arms, tailor your assault style to decimate the Altrius with a brutal and gorey fashion. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/0325f1a4b55390625e66b93a46e13d7f.poster.avif?t=1755132100\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/0325f1a4b55390625e66b93a46e13d7f.webm?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/0325f1a4b55390625e66b93a46e13d7f.mp4?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/11e3a65c4f0c2e63da9e076b4d43f1a2.avif?t=1755132100\" width=548 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remnants of a futuristic Lagos, uncovering the dark plans of the Altrius that could spell doom for humanity. Complete the narrative rich and action-packed campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/c1bee0275e153fe30bc48f3289551cbd.avif?t=1755132100\" width=1496 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/2dc8ffa31ebae9ed98295123f2e01466.avif?t=1755132100\" width=684 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the vibrant, apocalypse-touched world brought to life with both traditional hand-drawn animation mixed with AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/65526607def542b847f1038c6ab608ea.poster.avif?t=1755132100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/65526607def542b847f1038c6ab608ea.webm?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/65526607def542b847f1038c6ab608ea.mp4?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/59d2e5081661e57c20a0500e9f2fe65f.avif?t=1755132100\" width=1356 height=826 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/11ae206e468512622975023ed20184d3.avif?t=1755132100\" width=1042 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/7c14d617ddaffae113dd38da786e5584.avif?t=1755132100\" width=878 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in relentless enemy encounters and dynamic boss battles that ramp up in difficulty, groundbreaking action sequences with high replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/129941bb560d6fd486606cb3b424ccf0.poster.avif?t=1755132100\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/129941bb560d6fd486606cb3b424ccf0.webm?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/129941bb560d6fd486606cb3b424ccf0.mp4?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/810f0b57dcceeebd1d4b1d6554b26a50.avif?t=1755132100\" width=674 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the year 2073 in a post apocalyptic Lagos Nigeria, West Africa. Humanity is on the verge of extinction. The earth has fallen into ruin under the threat of an invasive alien species known as the Altrius.  Play as  Chimere Uzoma, a fierce and genetically enhanced human soldier called an &quot;Enforcer&quot;, who must protect one of the last enclaves of humanity called &quot;Azure&quot;. The Enforcers are created for one purpose: to turn the tide in the war against the Altrius. Dive into a narrative-rich campaign where the survival of humanity hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/900a1a893396da7afb7028802fb1123d.avif?t=1755132100\" width=780 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Introducing Synchronous Combat Mechanics System, Master an expansive combo system with interlinking moves across a variety of weapons. From melee swords and spears to projectile-based secondary arms, tailor your assault style to decimate the Altrius with a brutal and gorey fashion. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/0325f1a4b55390625e66b93a46e13d7f.poster.avif?t=1755132100\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/0325f1a4b55390625e66b93a46e13d7f.webm?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/0325f1a4b55390625e66b93a46e13d7f.mp4?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/11e3a65c4f0c2e63da9e076b4d43f1a2.avif?t=1755132100\" width=548 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remnants of a futuristic Lagos, uncovering the dark plans of the Altrius that could spell doom for humanity. Complete the narrative rich and action-packed campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/c1bee0275e153fe30bc48f3289551cbd.avif?t=1755132100\" width=1496 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/2dc8ffa31ebae9ed98295123f2e01466.avif?t=1755132100\" width=684 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the vibrant, apocalypse-touched world brought to life with both traditional hand-drawn animation mixed with AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/65526607def542b847f1038c6ab608ea.poster.avif?t=1755132100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/65526607def542b847f1038c6ab608ea.webm?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/65526607def542b847f1038c6ab608ea.mp4?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/59d2e5081661e57c20a0500e9f2fe65f.avif?t=1755132100\" width=1356 height=826 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/11ae206e468512622975023ed20184d3.avif?t=1755132100\" width=1042 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/7c14d617ddaffae113dd38da786e5584.avif?t=1755132100\" width=878 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in relentless enemy encounters and dynamic boss battles that ramp up in difficulty, groundbreaking action sequences with high replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/129941bb560d6fd486606cb3b424ccf0.poster.avif?t=1755132100\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/129941bb560d6fd486606cb3b424ccf0.webm?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949180/extras/129941bb560d6fd486606cb3b424ccf0.mp4?t=1755132100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
